@startuml SAYCEP_A3_Activity
' Assignment 3 Q3.5 - end-to-end journey with decisions, exceptions and
' completion states, as implemented in frontend/app.js.
' Version 1.1 (30 September): the occupation panel before choosing a
' target, and the saved My plan dashboard after the pathway (ADR-0006).
' Split in two for legibility: this is part A; part B (05b) is the dashboard.
title End-to-End Journey, part A: the five-screen journey (as implemented)
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FEFEFE

start
:Open SAYCEP;
if (Saved plan in this browser?) then (yes, and profile still exists)
  :Open My plan dashboard (Figure 5b);
  detach
else (no)
endif
repeat
  :Choose starting point;
repeat while (Choice made?) is (no - Continue disabled)
-> yes;
repeat
  :Tick skills held (35 O*NET skills);
repeat while (At least one skill ticked?) is (no - Continue disabled)
-> yes;
if (Create profile (POST /profiles) - succeeded?) then (no)
  #FBEAEA:Exception - show error banner;
  stop
endif

if (Profile type?) then (school-leaver)
  :Open on For you tab, Job Zones 1-3;
  #D6E8F5:Rank occupations by mean-centred cosine similarity;
  note right
    Emerging-technology step
    FR-06, TR-01 to TR-03
  end note
else (student)
  :Open on Search tab;
endif

repeat
  :Open a job via For you, Browse or Search,
  read its panel - what it involves, preparation,
  which skills you have;
repeat while (Aim for this job?) is (no - close panel)
-> yes;
if (Record target (PUT /profiles/id/target) - valid?) then (no - 404)
  #FBEAEA:Exception - show error banner;
  stop
endif

if (Compute skills gap - any skill missing?) then (no)
  :Completion - you already hold every skill,
  suggest a higher preparation level;
  stop
else (yes)
  :Classify each missing skill,
  essential at 3.5 or above, else desirable;
endif

:Generate pathway, 3 steps plus target; show it
with new / deeper badges and provenance;
if (Next action?) then (try a different target)
  :Return to target selection;
  stop
else (save as my plan)
  :Store profile id in this browser (not an account);
endif

:Continue in Figure 5b - My plan dashboard;
stop
@enduml
